# CoreMap main rules

CoreMap is a Myanmar map platform. V2 extends the existing system. Do not restart the architecture.

## Layer model

- PostgreSQL + PostGIS = source of truth
- Fastify API = business logic and authorization
- Dashboard, web, and mobile = API clients only
- PMTiles + Martin + MapLibre = map rendering only

## Hard rules

- No direct database access from dashboard, web, or mobile.
- No Prisma in dashboard, web, or mobile.
- No business logic in MapLibre style files.
- No important data stored only in tiles.
- No duplicate business logic in frontend.
- Sensitive admin actions need API authorization and audit.
- Keep changes small, clear, and safe.

